                <elementReference>$Record.Account.Ranking__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>HasChanges</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <assignments>
        <description>Primeira faixa que contem a media: grava o Ranking da faixa e marca como encontrada. As faixas seguintes nao sobrescrevem.</description>
        <name>AssignRanking</name>
        <label>Atribuir Ranking da Faixa</label>
        <locationX>842</locationX>
        <locationY>1316</locationY>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>NewRanking</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>LoopRanges.Ranking__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <assignmentItems>
            <assignToReference>RangeFound</assignToReference>
            <operator>Assign</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>LoopRanges</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <decisions>
        <description>Executa so no dia do mes configurado em ScheduledFlowOpportunitySetting__mdt (registro Default, hoje dia 14). Fluxo agendado nao tem frequencia mensal, por isso Daily com checagem do dia (P9).</description>
        <name>CheckDayMonth</name>
        <label>Verificar dia do mês</label>
        <locationX>974</locationX>
        <locationY>252</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Fora do dia</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Day1</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Day</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>GetSetting.RunDayOfMonth__c</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>CheckAccount</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Dia configurado</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Oportunidade sem conta nao tem o que classificar: termina.</description>
        <name>CheckAccount</name>
        <label>Oportunidade tem conta</label>
        <locationX>578</locationX>
        <locationY>252</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Sem conta</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>HasAccount</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.AccountId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>GetRepresentativeOpportunity</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Tem conta</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Execucao por conta sem gravar estado: so a interview da oportunidade ganha de menor Id da conta segue adiante. As demais terminam antes da soma, garantindo 1 calculo e no maximo 1 update por conta.</description>
        <name>IsRepresentative</name>
        <label>É a oportunidade representante</label>
        <locationX>578</locationX>
        <locationY>360</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Não é a representante</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>IsFirstOpportunity</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetRepresentativeOpportunity.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>GetOpportunities</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>É a representante</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Classificacao pela media (AveragePurchasesThisYear__c, P3). Media vazia nao altera o Ranking; media preenchida (inclusive 0) percorre as faixas de RankingRange__mdt.</description>
        <name>ClassifyRanking</name>
        <label>Classificar Ranking</label>
        <locationX>578</locationX>
        <locationY>984</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>GetRanges</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Média preenchida</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>AverageEmpty</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Account.AveragePurchasesThisYear__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>KeepCurrentRanking</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Média vazia</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Faixa vale se ainda nao houve faixa e a media e menor ou igual ao limite da faixa (inclusive), ou a faixa nao tem limite (3G, sem teto). Acima do limite anterior e garantido pela ordem de SortOrder__c.</description>
        <name>RangeMatches</name>
        <label>Faixa contém a média</label>
        <locationX>842</locationX>
        <locationY>1208</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>LoopRanges</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Não contém</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>InRange</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND (2 OR 3)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>RangeFound</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>LoopRanges.UpperLimit__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Account.AveragePurchasesThisYear__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>LessThanOrEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>LoopRanges.UpperLimit__c</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>AssignRanking</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Contém</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>So grava se a soma ou o Ranking mudaram. Sem mudanca nao ha update, evitando rodar a cadeia de automacao de Account (triggers, 2 flows after-save sem criterio de entrada) a toa.</description>
        <name>HasChanges</name>
        <label>Houve mudança</label>
        <locationX>578</locationX>
        <locationY>1500</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Sem mudança</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Changed</name>
            <conditionLogic>or</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>SumAmount</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>$Record.Account.LastMonthPurchaseValue__c</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>NewRanking</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>$Record.Account.Ranking__c</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>UpdateAccount</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Mudou</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <description>Envia e-mail so se houver destinatario configurado. Destinatario vazio (P11 pendente): so o log em IntegrationLog__c.</description>
        <name>HasRecipient</name>
        <label>Tem destinatário</label>
        <locationX>578</locationX>
        <locationY>1592</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Sem destinatário</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>RecipientFilled</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetSetting.FaultRecipient__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>SendFaultEmail</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Destinatário preenchido</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Fluxo agendado diario que, no dia do mes configurado em ScheduledFlowOpportunitySetting__mdt, calcula por conta a soma das oportunidades Fechado/Ganho do ano (Opportunity.ThisYear__c) em Account.LastMonthPurchaseValue__c e classifica Account.Ranking__c pela media AveragePurchasesThisYear__c, usando as faixas de RankingRange__mdt. Um calculo e no maximo um update por conta; falha no update gera IntegrationLog__c (IntegrationAction__c = ScheduledFlowOpportunity). EPLAST-47, versao 2.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Dia do mes da execucao, comparado com RunDayOfMonth__c.</description>
        <name>Day</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>DAY({!$Flow.CurrentDate})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Corpo do log e do aviso de falha: Id da conta e mensagem de erro. Sem dado de cliente.</description>
        <name>FaultBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Conta &quot; &amp; {!$Record.AccountId} &amp; &quot;: &quot; &amp; {!$Flow.FaultMessage}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Fluxo Agendado - Oportunidade {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Fluxo Agendado - Oportunidade</label>
    <loops>
        <description>Percorre as oportunidades ganhas do ano da conta para somar o Amount.</description>
        <name>LoopOpportunities</name>
        <label>Loop Oportunidades</label>
        <locationX>578</locationX>
        <locationY>576</locationY>
        <collectionReference>GetOpportunities</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>AssignSumValue</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>ClassifyRanking</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
    <loops>
        <description>Percorre as faixas de RankingRange__mdt em ordem de SortOrder__c ate achar a que contem a media.</description>
        <name>LoopRanges</name>
        <label>Loop Faixas</label>
        <locationX>842</locationX>
        <locationY>1100</locationY>
        <collectionReference>GetRanges</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
            <targetReference>RangeMatches</targetReference>
        </nextValueConnector>
        <noMoreValuesConnector>
            <targetReference>HasChanges</targetReference>
        </noMoreValuesConnector>
    </loops>
